image_sets_assistant_title = Assistant: derive steps from the layout
image_sets_assistant_intro = Describe how the image sits in the layout. The assistant calculates the real image widths per screen class (the same calculation the sizes attribute uses), rounds to 100 px, adds retina steps on request and drops steps that are less than 20 % apart.
